{
    "title": "MANGA BANG\uff01",
    "description": "MANGA BANG! is one of the most popular manga apps in Japan. \r\nEnjoy Manga straight from Japan & webtoons for free on MANGA BANG! Discover your next favorite with our curated collection of manga and webtoon titles! \r\nWith a wide range of genres including romance, comedy, fantasy, Josei, Shonen ai and more, MANGA BANG is the place to be! \r\nThere\u2019s something here for everyone, including exclusive, original comics only available on our app!\r\n\r\nFREE EPISODES EVERY DAY!\r\n\u30fbEvery 23 hours you unlock a ticket in each title, which you can use to continue reading where the free episodes left off.\r\n\r\nSTILL WANT MORE? USE  COINS!\r\n\u30fbUse coins to purchase the later episodes or to continue reading ticket episodes without waiting!\r\n\r\nGENRES OF MANGA AND VERTICAL SCROLL COMICS\r\n\u30fbCurrently featuring works that have been dramatized for TV in Japan and original works that have become big hits in Japan! \r\nWhether you prefer Japanese manga, Korean manhwa, Chinese manhua, webcomics or graphic novels, you can find them right here on MANGABANG! And since all our titles are licensed for distribution by the copyright holders, \r\nyou can enjoy them with complete peace of mind!\r\n\r\nFOR EXAMPLE :\r\n\u30fbCome enjoy classic titles such as \u201cThe Date of Marriage - If you can\u2019t have a fianc\u00e9 let\u2019s get married\u201d,\u201cI Picked up a Homeless Handsome Guy\u201d,\u201cEmbrace My Shadow or \u201cThe Boss\u2019s Shotgun Wedding\u201d.\r\n\u30fbEnjoy the beauty of young men in love with titles such as \u201cAscend\u201d and \u201cMy Childhood friend looks too good\u201d.\r\n\r\nRECOMMENDED FOR :\r\n\u30fbthose who are looking for a digital comics app that features vertically scrolling comics.\r\n\u30fbthose who enjoy reading professionally and accurately translated manga.\r\n\u30fbthose who enjoy romance and shoujo manga.\r\n\u30fbthose who are looking for a webcomic app that allows them to read both fantasy comics like isekai manga and romance manga and webtoons.",
    "descriptionHTML": "MANGA BANG! is one of the most popular manga apps in Japan. <br>Enjoy Manga straight from Japan &amp; webtoons for free on MANGA BANG! Discover your next favorite with our curated collection of manga and webtoon titles! <br>With a wide range of genres including romance, comedy, fantasy, Josei, Shonen ai and more, MANGA BANG is the place to be! <br>There\u2019s something here for everyone, including exclusive, original comics only available on our app!<br><br>FREE EPISODES EVERY DAY!<br>\u30fbEvery 23 hours you unlock a ticket in each title, which you can use to continue reading where the free episodes left off.<br><br>STILL WANT MORE? USE  COINS!<br>\u30fbUse coins to purchase the later episodes or to continue reading ticket episodes without waiting!<br><br>GENRES OF MANGA AND VERTICAL SCROLL COMICS<br>\u30fbCurrently featuring works that have been dramatized for TV in Japan and original works that have become big hits in Japan! <br>Whether you prefer Japanese manga, Korean manhwa, Chinese manhua, webcomics or graphic novels, you can find them right here on MANGABANG! And since all our titles are licensed for distribution by the copyright holders, <br>you can enjoy them with complete peace of mind!<br><br>FOR EXAMPLE :<br>\u30fbCome enjoy classic titles such as \u201cThe Date of Marriage - If you can\u2019t have a fianc\u00e9 let\u2019s get married\u201d,\u201cI Picked up a Homeless Handsome Guy\u201d,\u201cEmbrace My Shadow or \u201cThe Boss\u2019s Shotgun Wedding\u201d.<br>\u30fbEnjoy the beauty of young men in love with titles such as \u201cAscend\u201d and \u201cMy Childhood friend looks too good\u201d.<br><br>RECOMMENDED FOR :<br>\u30fbthose who are looking for a digital comics app that features vertically scrolling comics.<br>\u30fbthose who enjoy reading professionally and accurately translated manga.<br>\u30fbthose who enjoy romance and shoujo manga.<br>\u30fbthose who are looking for a webcomic app that allows them to read both fantasy comics like isekai manga and romance manga and webtoons.",
